					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-400282#post-4217022</guid>
				<title>Image attribution</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-400282/scp-918#post-4217022</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 12 Apr 2019 15:59:04 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Voct</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>392303</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Tineye showed that this image was used on the Daily Mail, who credited to Alamy; I know that Alamy sells a lot of stuff that's actually available for free, so i checked the myriad of suitably-licensed Marabou Stork pictures on Wikimedia Commons. This is not one of them. It's also not from Flickr. Alamy credits it to &quot;Llukee&quot;, who is a contributor to PBase.</p> <p><a href="https://www.alamy.com/stock-photo-marabou-stork-bird-uganda-africa-20971730.html">https://www.alamy.com/stock-photo-marabou-stork-bird-uganda-africa-20971730.html</a></p> <p>note that PBase specifies its content is copyrighted.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
