				<wikidot:authorName>Anaxagoras</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1019930</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>That is not what Lolfoundation is. It is a slightly humorous main-lister, yes. But the Foundation is not shown acting in a wildly unprofessional manner, or indeed doing much at all other than very standard containment.</p> <p>And really, this is more an out-of-universe amusing twist on a bit of folklore. I dread to think what you'd make of Pesterbot, which is funny in-universe and out.</p> 
				 	]]>
